{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は2幕に出れました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パムに立候補してて\nパムはできなかったけど\nエリザベートをやらせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1幕は上手くできなかったけど\nやりたい気持ちが伝わったかな\nと思うと嬉しい(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私に投票してくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/06/1666651/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリザベート楽しかったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メグとエリザベートは\n動きがほぼ一緒なんだけど\n今日はきょうちゃんがメグやってたから\n裏でいろいろ話してたよ(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうちゃん可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/06/1666651/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル始まってから\n2期生と一緒になる機会ができて\nやっといろいろ\n喋れるようになった感じがしてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/06/1666651/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\n真夏と一緒に2幕に立てたよ(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互い10役ではないけど\n二人とも2幕に立てたのは\n実は、昨日が初めてなんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2幕二人で出たいね\nって言ってたところだから嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/06/1666651/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/06/1666651/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","